 },
 "summary": "A three-pole female XLR receptacle that mounts from the rear of a front panel and solders horizontally to a PCB. It is the A-series body with a metal mounting flange whose ground contact runs all the way round to the chassis, for EMC and RF protection. Pin 1 connects directly to the mating connector's shell and to the front panel; there is no separate ground contact. Each contact is rated 6 A at under 50 V, over -30 °C to +80 °C.",
